NOTE on paths: the generated prompt's idealized output path
(apps/windows/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/*.xaml + *ViewModel.cs) does not exist in this
repository. The established, building W7 convention is a code-built WinUI UserControl page
under apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/<Page>/ split into
view (.cs) + ViewModel.cs + Model.cs + Source.cs, with the headless logic compiled into
TeslaSync.App.Tests via <Compile Include> links. This artifact follows that real convention
(identical to the sibling done pages ApiLogsPage / SignalLogViewerPage). No web pixel-cloning.

Data source bound through the generated C# client (manifest):
  useVehicles  GET /vehicles  → RedisSignalViewerClientFeed.FetchVehiclesAsync
                                 (Operations get_api_v1_vehicles)
Page behaviour also binds (web getRedisSignals/purge/purgeAll, generated client):
  GET    /dev-tools/redis-signals?vehicle_id=…   get_api_v1_dev_tools_redis_signals
  DELETE /dev-tools/redis-signals?vehicle_id=…   delete_api_v1_dev_tools_redis_signals
  DELETE /dev-tools/redis-signals/keys           delete_api_v1_dev_tools_redis_signals_keys

